LKED INTO THE CONVENTION IT DESCRIBES: the first filing spelled that last sentence with an inline attribution token followed by a full stop, the parser took the LAST match, and the reports slice refused the entry as unattributable. The description of a schema gap reproduced the schema gap. --- NO FIELD IS PROPOSED. The owner has research running on this through Toulmin's verbs and named ship-as-is as a live outcome; summit inventing a field mid-analysis would be the venue pre-empting the owner on the owner's own tool. This is evidence, not a proposal.}
