@misc{friction-a-prose-marker-cannot-tell-being-in-a-state-from-describing-one,
  title  = {A prose marker cannot distinguish being in a state from describing one},
  claim  = {Summit records EVENTS and computes CONDITIONS: nothing carries a status field, and an
            ask is open exactly when its check exits non-zero. Where the event is a MACHINE fact
            that works. Where the event is a HUMAN ACT recorded in prose, the reader is a substring
            match, and a substring cannot tell a party IN a state from a party DESCRIBING one.
