            selecting the `summit-concept:` verdict LINE first and splitting that. ⚑⚑ THE RULE WAS
            ALREADY IN THE FILE, TWO BRANCHES ABOVE, IN CAPITALS: *"THE TEST IS THE EXIT PROTOCOL,
            NOT THE TEXT — AND THE TEXT VERSION WAS WRONG TWICE IN ONE HOUR."* That comment records
