r has established 0 would make the probe's reach the finding. AND THE ROOT DEFECT WAS A MISSING NEGATIVE ARM AT EVERY PASS: each selftest proved the probe could FIND its target and never that it could DECLINE a near-miss, so a probe calibrated on a single positive reported its own shape three times running. The arms now carry a shared UTILITY is not counted and a route calling it TWICE is a combinator, explicitly.},
